# Nothing under `game/assets/species/` is ignored any more. The creature models
# are the project's own (decision 0071) and the tile pack is licensed for
# redistribution (decision 0074), so both are committed through LFS — see
# `.gitattributes`. A clone therefore renders instead of opening a world that is
# walkable and completely invisible.
